    glyph:
      'M 10 34 Q 32 22 54 34 Q 32 44 10 34 Z M 28 30 L 28 18 Q 30 14 34 14 Q 38 14 38 20 L 38 30',
    image: '/images/ritual-fetal-pose.jpg',
    title: 'THE THUMB',
    directive: 'PUT YOUR THUMB IN YOUR MOUTH.',
    subtext: 'You know the one. Left or right. It remembers.',
