// TRAVEL EVENTS — 30 EVENT SKELETONS  (v0.9.0)
// ============================================================
// Events that can trigger during route traversal between nodes.
// Each event has a type, weight, effect, and placeholder dialogue
// fields marked [WESLEY] for Wesley to fill with flavour copy.
//
// Events are rolled per-step during travel animation. The route's
// eventWeight multiplier affects the chance of triggering.
//
// THIS FILE IS PURE DATA + TYPES. No rendering.
