// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// BMF:3K SPRINT 1 + 2 — playable React tactical prototype.
// S1: grid movement · vision-cone stealth · garbage looting · tone encounters · heat/stress.
// S2: selectable crew · passive skills · one-shot main abilities · directive cards.
